  {
   "id": "p2",
   "text": "There are two very different causes. The first is the agent: it may write a worse query, or search in a language where the evidence is not. We call that the query-side gap. The second is the web itself. Hindi Wikipedia has about two percent of the articles of English Wikipedia. If the fact was never written in Hindi, no Hindi query will find it. We call that the evidence-side gap.",
