  {
   "id": "p3",
   "text": "To separate them, we built an instrument. The same question in two languages: human-translated Hindi and English pairs, and Telugu and English pairs. The same evidence served three ways: a frozen pool of Wikipedia text served English-only, Indic-only, or both. A search agent that may search three times and then must answer. And a log of the script of every query it writes.",
